                                        "entry_id": "78e85084-9f52-3021-9c4c-3cce33b4cf21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An agreement between parties concerning the sale of property; or a contract by which one party binds themself to transfer the right to some property for a consideration, and the other party binds themself to receive the property and pay the consideration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3824b91a-93fb-47f8-9310-aaad9549c37e",
                                                "sense_id": "e5159916-06ee-3916-9a58-42545abeb68a",
                                                "text": "A contract is a bargain that is legally binding."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4ee9a47-2447-322e-b4a4-3abfe68c4149",
                                        "entry_id": "78e85084-9f52-3021-9c4c-3cce33b4cf21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An agreement or stipulation; mutual pledge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f727c8d8-b18a-422f-b5d2-b1df12f3f962",
                                                "sense_id": "d4ee9a47-2447-322e-b4a4-3abfe68c4149",
                                                "text": "[…]And when your honors mean to solemnize\n The bargain of your faith, I do beseech you,\n Even at that time I may be married too."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef394636-2cd8-3c49-b025-a5a47b403185",
                                        "entry_id": "78e85084-9f52-3021-9c4c-3cce33b4cf21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An item purchased for significantly less than the usual, or recommended, price"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c5d6ea2-b4ae-3f26-804a-bad7dbb852a6",
                                        "entry_id": "78e85084-9f52-3021-9c4c-3cce33b4cf21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A gainful transaction; an advantageous purchase."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19137c3d-b6d5-4510-8ec5-2f68c85c351b",
                                                "sense_id": "0c5d6ea2-b4ae-3f26-804a-bad7dbb852a6",
                                                "text": "to buy (something) at a bargain"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a5e8175-17fc-405d-aaf2-b35efbfb4a23",
                                                "sense_id": "0c5d6ea2-b4ae-3f26-804a-bad7dbb852a6",
                                                "text": "At that price, it’s not just a bargain, it’s a steal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "238c43cc-3775-445a-8214-a9cdc909b98c",
                                                "sense_id": "0c5d6ea2-b4ae-3f26-804a-bad7dbb852a6",
                                                "text": "Thus the red damask curtains which now shut out the fog-laden, drizzling atmosphere of the Marylebone Road, had cost a mere song, and yet they might have been warranted to last another thirty years. A great bargain also had been the excellent Axminster carpet which covered the floor;[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58b6a9cd-30fa-3370-945b-2cd095577492",
                                        "entry_id": "78e85084-9f52-3021-9c4c-3cce33b4cf21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The thing stipulated or purchased."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47e6e0e1-85ae-4ac2-8765-5660748dea75",
                                                "sense_id": "58b6a9cd-30fa-3370-945b-2cd095577492",
                                                "text": "If he say so, may his pernicious soul Rot half a grain a day! He lies to th' heart. She was too fond of her most filthy bargain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bargain",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d377837-3e88-39aa-97fb-58d1f5e1dfd6",
                                        "entry_id": "14aca7b0-63e4-33db-b94a-b5354c834d89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a bargain; to make a deal or contract for the exchange of property or services; to negotiate; to haggle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da597b22-5a04-4483-9b22-2a4c7bf1900a",
                                                "sense_id": "2d377837-3e88-39aa-97fb-58d1f5e1dfd6",
                                                "text": "They had to bargain for a few minutes to get a decent price for the rug."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70729c0b-a679-4af9-8f62-f53fd8e2f2d2",
                                                "sense_id": "2d377837-3e88-39aa-97fb-58d1f5e1dfd6",
                                                "text": "So worthless peasants bargain for their wives.\nUnited we bargain, divided we beg"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d2bc31e-7e07-3508-abc3-461133b079d3",
                                        "entry_id": "14aca7b0-63e4-33db-b94a-b5354c834d89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To transfer for a consideration; to barter; to trade"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
